5
00:01:44,404 --> 00:01:46,612
<b>We need to stick together, so we don't forget.</b>

6
00:01:47,737 --> 00:01:49,571
<b>Together we're strong. You understand, right?</b>

7
00:01:50,321 --> 00:01:53,029
<b>But none of you ever believed me.</b>

8
00:01:54,154 --> 00:01:55,821
<b>You said 'he' attacked you, Gadis.</b>

9
00:01:57,446 --> 00:01:59,696
<b>I felt everything, Dewi.</b>

10
00:02:01,362 --> 00:02:02,821
<b>We are free from him.</b>

11
00:02:03,946 --> 00:02:04,904
<b>A long time ago.</b>

12
00:02:05,987 --> 00:02:07,654
<b>We're stronger than him.</b>

13
00:02:14,154 --> 00:02:16,946
<b>Who did this to you?</b>

14
00:02:22,196 --> 00:02:24,279
