15
00:02:30,112 --> 00:02:30,987
<b>I don't know.</b>

16
00:02:31,154 --> 00:02:33,237
<b>Trust me, Dewi</b>

17
00:02:33,737 --> 00:02:37,654
<b>I felt him, the same way I'm feeling you right now.</b>

18
00:02:44,696 --> 00:02:45,571
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19
00:02:47,404 --> 00:02:50,737
<b>He's dead. Remember that day, right?</b>

20
00:02:57,112 --> 00:03:01,654
<b>He's staring at you right now. Smiling.</b>

21
00:03:27,071 --> 00:03:28,904
<b>I'll stay here tonight.</b>

22
00:04:03,862 --> 00:04:04,487
<b>Yes, Budi?</b>

23
00:04:04,487 --> 00:04:05,862
<b>You're with her?</b>

24
00:04:06,196 --> 00:04:07,487
<b>Yes, with Gadis.</b>

25
00:04:09,279 --> 00:04:10,946
