85
00:16:13,737 --> 00:16:14,612
<b>Bitch..</b>

86
00:16:20,446 --> 00:16:22,154
<b>You like being electrocuted?</b>

87
00:16:26,821 --> 00:16:29,071
<b>Here, want to get even?</b>

88
00:16:42,404 --> 00:16:43,446
<b>What do you want?</b>

89
00:16:43,987 --> 00:16:45,362
<b>Why did you take us here?</b>

90
00:16:49,487 --> 00:16:50,654
<b>You'll find out!</b>

91
00:16:56,529 --> 00:16:57,446
<b>What's wrong with her?</b>

92
00:16:59,112 --> 00:16:59,946
<b>Guess she fell.</b>

93
00:17:06,154 --> 00:17:07,154
<b>My name is Budi.</b>

94
00:17:16,904 --> 00:17:19,071
<b>Alfie, I'm Jenar.</b>

95
00:17:19,821 --> 00:17:20,779
<b>That's Leo.</b>

96
00:17:22,279 --> 00:17:23,987
<b>First, let me apologize.</b>

97
00:17:24,612 --> 00:17:26,696
<b>- If there's any other way
- One more time!</b>

98
00:17:28,279 --> 00:17:29,112
<b>Where's Nara?</b>

99
00:17:31,779 --> 00:17:33,571
<b>Calm down, Alfie.</b>

100
00:17:35,029 --> 00:17:36,404
<b>I wasn't asking you.</b>

101
00:17:38,654 --> 00:17:39,946
<b>She's with the others.</b>

102
00:17:40,862 --> 00:17:42,696
<b>She's okay. Trust me!</b>

103
00:17:43,362 --> 00:17:44,654
<b>What do you want from us?</b>

104
00:17:45,571 --> 00:17:46,779
<b>We have nothing.</b>

105
00:17:47,404 --> 00:17:48,987
<b>That's not it.</b>

106
00:17:50,821 --> 00:17:51,946
<b>Do you know this place?</b>

107
00:17:55,862 --> 00:17:57,071
<b>Bahtera Orphanage.</b>

108
00:17:57,446 --> 00:17:59,404
<b>This was once a place for orphans</b>

109
00:17:59,404 --> 00:18:01,571
<b>built by a childless husband and wife.</b>

110
00:18:08,487 --> 00:18:10,946
<b>This place was once filled with warmth.</b>

111
00:18:10,946 --> 00:18:13,404
<b>Who were abandoned by their own birth parents.</b>

112
00:18:22,737 --> 00:18:24,071
<b>But everything changed.</b>

113
00:18:26,612 --> 00:18:29,112
<b>Since the wife passed away.</b>

114
00:18:33,029 --> 00:18:36,029
<b>At that time, there were 7 kids who weren't adopted yet.</b>

115
00:18:36,571 --> 00:18:38,237
<b>Years passed.</b>

116
00:18:41,654 --> 00:18:43,029
<b>They grew older.</b>

117
00:18:47,029 --> 00:18:48,612
<b>And they were still living here.</b>

118
00:18:51,487 --> 00:18:52,946
<b>There they realized.</b>

119
00:18:57,029 --> 00:19:00,404
<b>Not all adults have the intention to keep them safe.</b>

120
00:19:03,196 --> 00:19:04,487
<b>Gradually.</b>

121
00:19:07,654 --> 00:19:10,362
<b>This home turned into a terrifying place.</b>

122
00:19:13,112 --> 00:19:14,071
<b>Sir!</b>

123
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:15,821
<b>Sir!</b>

124
00:19:16,404 --> 00:19:17,362
<b>Sir!</b>

125
00:19:17,946 --> 00:19:19,154
<b>Please open the door, Sir!</b>

126
00:19:19,279 --> 00:19:21,654
<b>- The one person they considered
- Sir! Please, Sir!</b>

127
00:19:21,654 --> 00:19:25,362
<b>- Became a figure that turn their childhood a living hell.
- Sir! Please, Sir!</b>

128
00:19:27,071 --> 00:19:30,862
<b>Anyone dared to disobey were locked in the kitchen.</b>

129
00:19:33,946 --> 00:19:37,529
<b>Without food. Without water. Without lights.</b>

130
00:19:37,696 --> 00:19:39,862
<b>In total silence.</b>

131
00:19:41,404 --> 00:19:43,071
<b>Even for days.</b>

132
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:51,696
<b>Alfie, do you know how it feels going through a nightmare.</b>

133
00:19:51,696 --> 00:19:53,529
<b>That never ends?</b>

134
00:19:55,029 --> 00:19:59,404
<b>I know how it feels to wake up from a nightmare.</b>

135
00:20:00,946 --> 00:20:05,654
<b>And realize that real life is worse.</b>

136
00:20:12,737 --> 00:20:13,779
<b>Why don't you just cut to the chase.</b>

137
00:20:15,529 --> 00:20:17,237
<b>After this place was closed down.</b>

138
00:20:23,279 --> 00:20:25,696
<b>The children were separated to live in different orphanages.</b>

139
00:20:28,279 --> 00:20:30,237
<b>Living their own lives.</b>

140
00:20:32,196 --> 00:20:35,237
<b>But promised to never forget each other.</b>

141
00:20:48,071 --> 00:20:53,821
<b>So, the Police didn't know all of you killed the foster
father?</b>

142
00:20:54,071 --> 00:20:55,987
<b>Where was the Police when we were locked up?</b>

143
00:20:56,696 --> 00:20:57,779
<b>- Tortured?
- Leo!</b>

144
00:20:57,987 --> 00:20:59,612
<b>- Forced to naked? Forced to
- Leo!</b>

145
00:20:59,946 --> 00:21:00,946
<b>Don't worry.</b>

146
00:21:02,529 --> 00:21:07,529
<b>You're facing with someone who burnt her own step sister.</b>

147
00:21:22,154 --> 00:21:23,196
<b>Let's go downstairs.</b>

148
00:21:26,904 --> 00:21:29,029
<b>Bud? Cheeky bastard!</b>

149
00:21:29,029 --> 00:21:30,446
<b>I'm okay. It's okay!</b>

150
00:21:31,321 --> 00:21:32,529
<b>That's for this morning.</b>

151
00:21:37,946 --> 00:21:39,196
<b>From your closet.</b>

152
00:21:39,904 --> 00:21:41,446
<b>Are you okay?</b>

153
00:23:44,112 --> 00:23:45,446
<b>She's taking too long.</b>

154
00:23:45,904 --> 00:23:47,112
<b>Find her would you?</b>

155
00:23:47,529 --> 00:23:48,487
<b>There she is.</b>

156
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,612
<b>Its all neatly cut.</b>

157
00:23:54,696 --> 00:23:55,654
<b>Here, eat.</b>

158
00:23:58,487 --> 00:24:00,321
<b>Nara! Nara!</b>

159
00:24:00,862 --> 00:24:02,071
<b>Are you okay?</b>

160
00:24:03,362 --> 00:24:04,029
<b>I'm okay.</b>

161
00:24:04,112 --> 00:24:04,862
<b>Alfie.</b>

162
00:24:06,487 --> 00:24:07,196
<b>Sit down.</b>

163
00:24:17,071 --> 00:24:17,862
<b>Alfie.</b>

164
00:24:18,571 --> 00:24:21,654
<b>This is Gadis. Marta. And Kristi.</b>

165
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:23,737
<b>Again, I apologize.</b>

166
00:24:24,737 --> 00:24:26,654
<b>We mean no harm to both of you.</b>

167
00:24:29,654 --> 00:24:30,529
<b>We're desperate</b>

168
00:24:30,987 --> 00:24:32,029
<b>What do you mean?</b>

169
00:24:32,737 --> 00:24:33,737
<b>We believe.</b>

170
00:24:34,696 --> 00:24:36,029
<b>Our foster father, Mister Ayub,</b>

171
00:24:37,446 --> 00:24:38,821
<b>Has returned..for vengeance.</b>

172
00:24:39,029 --> 00:24:40,279
<b>Returned from?</b>

173
00:24:40,904 --> 00:24:41,946
<b>Death.</b>

174
00:24:42,612 --> 00:24:45,196
<b>Gadis encountered him, she was the first to be attacked.</b>

175
00:24:45,862 --> 00:24:48,196
<b>We did'nt believe her. Until</b>

176
00:24:49,571 --> 00:24:50,571
<b>Until he killed Dewi.</b>

177
00:24:50,946 --> 00:24:52,779
<b>Not 100 % proven, though.</b>

178
00:24:53,071 --> 00:24:55,321
<b>I saw it with my own eyes.</b>

179
00:24:55,321 --> 00:24:56,737
<b>Dewi was killed by..</b>

180
00:24:58,071 --> 00:24:59,029
<b>Something.</b>

181
00:24:59,321 --> 00:25:01,696
<b>Let's get things straight.</b>

182
00:25:01,904 --> 00:25:04,571
<b>There was no other witness, you were alone with Dewi.</b>

183
00:25:05,737 --> 00:25:06,987
<b>What did you say?</b>

184
00:25:08,362 --> 00:25:10,404
<b>Have you seen what's done to her body?</b>

185
00:25:11,612 --> 00:25:13,862
<b>None of you ever trusted me.</b>

186
00:25:14,737 --> 00:25:15,737
<b>And look what happens.</b>

187
00:25:16,654 --> 00:25:18,904
<b>- Because you've always been strange
- Kristi!</b>

188
00:25:19,487 --> 00:25:21,696
<b>If you canÃ•t be supportive then leave.</b>

189
00:25:25,987 --> 00:25:28,696
<b>Just because I doubt, doesn't mean I don't grieve.</b>

190
00:25:36,446 --> 00:25:38,737
<b>Enough. What do you all want?</b>

191
00:25:40,196 --> 00:25:41,821
<b>Nara and I just want to go home.</b>

192
00:25:44,071 --> 00:25:47,071
<b>You testified to the Police that your father dealt with
witchcraft</b>

193
00:25:48,196 --> 00:25:50,279
<b>And you witnessed it with yourself.</b>

194
00:25:51,196 --> 00:25:54,029
<b>There must be a reason why Ayub's able to exist here.</b>

195
00:25:59,279 --> 00:26:00,029
<b>Gadis.</b>

196
00:26:38,112 --> 00:26:39,071
<b>Sorry, Alfie.</b>

197
00:26:40,946 --> 00:26:42,196
<b>These must be unpleasantly familiar.</b>

198
00:26:44,571 --> 00:26:45,487
<b>Have a drink.</b>

199
00:26:55,362 --> 00:26:56,904
<b>Where did that Book come from?</b>

200
00:27:00,071 --> 00:27:01,696
<b>I was a kid then, but I remember..</b>

201
00:27:03,112 --> 00:27:04,862
<b>A woman came over.</b>

202
00:27:05,654 --> 00:27:07,196
<b>She gave the Bible to Ayub.</b>

203
00:27:08,362 --> 00:27:09,362
<b>A woman?</b>

204
00:27:11,571 --> 00:27:13,904
<b>I never found out who she was.</b>

205
00:27:16,321 --> 00:27:17,737
<b>As Jenar said.</b>

206
00:27:19,154 --> 00:27:20,862
<b>Every day was torment for us.</b>

207
00:27:26,987 --> 00:27:30,779
<b>I don't know why Ayub gets himself entangled with these
things.</b>

208
00:27:31,946 --> 00:27:33,446
<b>In my father's case</b>

209
00:27:34,029 --> 00:27:35,571
<b>..Greed.</b>

210
00:27:36,737 --> 00:27:38,196
<b>But Ayub,</b>

211
00:27:38,904 --> 00:27:40,821
<b>Perhaps something to do with his late wife?</b>

212
00:27:41,654 --> 00:27:44,154
<b>Would that kind of ritual brings his wife back?</b>

213
00:27:46,779 --> 00:27:49,154
<b>Bud, come in. How is she?</b>

214
00:27:51,987 --> 00:27:53,654
<b>Everything is okay. Over.</b>

215
00:27:53,779 --> 00:27:54,737
<b>Okay.</b>

216
00:27:56,154 --> 00:27:57,654
<b>Cellphone's useless around here.</b>

217
00:27:59,696 --> 00:28:00,612
<b>Let's go inside.</b>

218
00:28:01,612 --> 00:28:02,362
<b>Wait!</b>

219
00:28:03,404 --> 00:28:05,071
<b>I need to know what you want from me?</b>

220
00:28:08,779 --> 00:28:10,112
<b>After Dewi's death.</b>

221
00:28:12,196 --> 00:28:13,737
<b>Marta researched the Bible..</b>

222
00:28:15,029 --> 00:28:16,071
<b>And she believes,</b>

223
00:28:17,196 --> 00:28:18,737
<b>Dewi's death is just the beginning.</b>

224
00:28:20,904 --> 00:28:23,571
<b>That something embeds in all of us after we killed Ayub.</b>

225
00:28:27,987 --> 00:28:28,654
<b>What is it?</b>

226
00:28:32,112 --> 00:28:32,904
<b>A curse.</b>

227
00:28:54,321 --> 00:28:56,654
<b>Back then, this room terrifies us the most.</b>

228
00:28:58,362 --> 00:29:00,362
<b>We always felt there's something down there.</b>

229
00:29:01,529 --> 00:29:02,404
<b>Ready to come out.</b>

230
00:29:26,279 --> 00:29:27,946
<b>None of you ever go down there?</b>

231
00:29:28,904 --> 00:29:30,071
<b>Only Ayub did.</b>

232
00:29:36,612 --> 00:29:38,154
<b>Leo, help me out.</b>

233
00:29:46,362 --> 00:29:47,487
<b>Keep pushing.</b>

234
00:29:54,029 --> 00:29:54,779
<b>Let's go.</b>

235
00:29:57,946 --> 00:29:58,821
<b>I'm not going.</b>

236
00:30:01,071 --> 00:30:02,654
<b>Thought you don't believe in this.</b>

237
00:30:02,946 --> 00:30:03,696
