<b>Ayub. Where is he?</b>

709
01:40:56,112 --> 01:41:00,196
<b>In eternal damnation.</b>

710
01:41:12,362 --> 01:41:13,571
<b>Come on then!</b>

711
01:41:16,487 --> 01:41:17,904
<b>Do it!</b>

712
01:41:24,737 --> 01:41:31,612
<b>Are you so foolish, to escape from your own destiny,</b>

713
01:41:33,112 --> 01:41:37,779
<b>even after losing so much.</b>

714
01:41:37,821 --> 01:41:40,654
<b>Even after everything?</b>

715
01:41:40,737 --> 01:41:44,904
<b>Even after everything?</b>

716
01:41:45,154 --> 01:41:49,696
<b>You choose to selfishly extinguish your own life.</b>

717
01:41:49,737 --> 01:41:53,154
<b>As if your soul belongs to you.</b>

718
01:41:53,196 --> 01:41:56,446
<b>As if your soul belongs to only you.</b>

719
01:41:56,529 --> 01:41:58,487
<b>No!</b>

720
01:41:58,571 --> 01:42:01,112
<b>No!</b>

721
01:42:04,029 --> 01:42:11,071
<b>Your filthy soul has been mine since you were but a child.</b>

722
01:42:13,404 --> 01:42:17,446
<b>Only I shall claim it!</b>

723
01:42:17,779 --> 01:42:22,112
<b>Your soul belongs to Moloch!</b>

724
01:42:47,654 --> 01:42:48,654
<b>Alfie..</b>

725
01:43:45,904 --> 01:43:48,237
<b>Alfie, let's go.</b>

726
01:44:19,529 --> 01:44:20,362
<b>Budi.</b>

727
01:44:22,612 --> 01:44:24,696
<b>Now you can start to find a decent job.</b>

728
01:44:26,196 --> 01:44:29,737
<b>So, you can buy a nicer car. Okay?</b>

729
01:44:33,779 --> 01:44:36,821
<b>Anyway, do we still need this?</b>

730
01:44:38,071 --> 01:44:39,404
<b>Or is it too dangerous?</b>

731
01:44:41,737 --> 01:44:44,696
<b>Dangerous? What's that?</b>

732
01:44:49,071 --> 01:44:51,487
<b>Nara, seat belt please.</b>

